sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Canonical worker (decision.rs)
  participant EI as escalation_input.rs
  participant AR as routing_state::advisory
  participant B as Budget ledger (Helper attempt)
  participant T as Async driver / transport
  participant P as Remote evaluator
  W->>EI: admitted failure evidence
  EI-->>W: bounded advisory request or abstain
  W->>AR: record_request + schedule + claim
  W->>B: bind finite-qualified helper reservation
  W->>T: submit once (source, qualification, credential, pause, deadline checks)
  T->>P: request
  P-->>T: response
  T->>B: independent usage settlement
  T->>AR: record_result (accepted_current or historical_stale)
  AR-->>W: shadow comparison only · admitted escalation unchanged
